## Pipeline Overview

This project uses a five-stage pipeline (T0 → T4) aligned with the DORA/Farley model:

| Stage | Name | Trigger | Wall-clock target | Gating |
|-------|------|---------|-------------------|--------|
| T0 | Local pre-push | Dev machine | < 30 s | Blocks push (hook) |
| T1 | PR-fast | PR open/sync | < 5 min (ceil 10) | **Blocking** |
| T2 | PR-extended | Path/size/label | < 20 min | **Blocking when triggered** |
| T3 | Release | Merge to main / tag | < 40 min | **Blocking** |
| T4 | Nightly | Cron 02:00–03:00 UTC | Up to 4 h | Informational + alert |
<% if (collaborationMode === 'trunk-solo') { %>
| T4+ | Solo reactivation | Nightly (T4 run) | < 1 min | **Blocking if triggered** |
<% } %>

