## T0 — Local Pre-Push

**Trigger:** `git push` (pre-push hook)
**Wall-clock:** < 30 seconds
**Gating:** Blocks push; developer must fix before pushing

<% if (governanceLevel === 'L1') { %>
At **L1**, T0 runs:
- Format check (`<%= formatCommand ?? 'npx prettier --check .' %>`)
- Lint (`<%= lintCommand ?? 'npm run lint' %>`)
<% } %>
<% if (governanceLevel === 'L2') { %>
At **L2**, T0 runs:
- Format check
- Lint
- Unit tests (`<%= testCommand ?? 'npm test' %>`)
- Build (`<%= buildCommand ?? 'npm run build' %>`)
<% } %>
<% if (governanceLevel === 'L3' || governanceLevel === 'L4') { %>
At **<%= governanceLevel %>**, T0 runs:
- Format check
- Lint
- Unit tests + coverage check
- Build
- Type-check
- Debt ratchet (duplication + complexity must not regress)
<% } %>

**Script:** `node scripts/check-all.mjs L1` (pre-commit) + `node scripts/check-all.mjs L2` (pre-push)

