## Where Failures Block

| Failure type | Where it blocks |
|-------------|-----------------|
| Format / lint | T0 (pre-push) — blocks push |
| Unit tests | T0 (pre-push) — blocks push |
| Build | T0 (pre-push) — blocks push |
<% if (collaborationMode !== 'trunk-solo') { %>
| Coverage threshold | T1 (PR-fast) — blocks merge |
| Integration tests | T1/T2 (PR) — blocks merge |
| SAST | T1/T2 (PR) — blocks merge |
<% } else { %>
| Coverage threshold | T0 (L2 pre-push hook) — blocks push |
| Integration tests | T4 (nightly) — alerts; does not block push |
<% } %>
| Release artifact signing | T3 (release) — blocks release |
<% if (collaborationMode === 'trunk-solo' && (governanceLevel === 'L3' || governanceLevel === 'L4')) { %>
| Reactivation trigger | T4 (nightly) — alerts; requires immediate remediation |
<% } %>
| Nightly CVE scan (high+) | T4 (nightly) — alerts via workflow failure |

