## Governance Level: <%= governanceLevel %> Summary

<% if (governanceLevel === 'L1') { %>
**L1 — Starter:** Format + lint + unit tests locally. No nightly. No mutation. Minimal CI.
Best for: prototypes, internal tools, early-stage projects.
<% } %>
<% if (governanceLevel === 'L2') { %>
**L2 — Standard:** Full local gate + PR CI with integration tests + nightly CVE refresh.
Coverage threshold: 80%. SLSA L2 on releases. Best for: production services, team projects.
<% } %>
<% if (governanceLevel === 'L3') { %>
**L3 — Regulated:** L2 + mutation testing + SAST + architecture tests + coverage 85%.
<% if (collaborationMode === 'trunk-solo') { %>
With `trunk-solo`: nightly reactivation check instead of PR reviewer gates.
<% } %>
Best for: regulated contexts, financial, healthcare, compliance-audited systems.
<% } %>
<% if (governanceLevel === 'L4') { %>
**L4 — Maximum:** L3 + SLSA L3 provenance + SBOM + cosign attestation + binary pinning.
Full audit trail for every artifact. Requires peer-review or gated-review collaboration mode
for sustained operation (trunk-solo at L4 is blocked by arbiter coherence check).
Best for: publicly audited, open-source critical infrastructure, regulated release pipelines.
<% } %>

